=== alley ===
The service alley is wet, practical, and full of things nobody wants to inventory.

* [Inspect the pharmacy bag]
    ~ discover_evidence("pharmacy_footage")
    The bag is visible in a reflection from the pharmacy's camera.
    -> alley
* [Inspect the delivery cart]
    Dan's route sticker is still on the handle. The cart can reach the café in under two minutes, which makes him possible and not guilty.
    -> alley
* [Inspect the drain]
    The rain has taken the paper label off a small bottle. The bottle itself is gone.
    -> alley
-> END
